  <item>
    <title>Vol.115 广深游记（liushuizhang)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a9698f5a0210c197dcbabfc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a9698f5a0210c197dcbabfc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期主播：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>大盆（小红书@好大一个盆儿)</span></strong></p><p><span>Hi这期又是一期个人瞎叨叨的游记播客，是今年初去广州深圳演出，顺便游玩的经历，两个地方都是好吃又好逛，！没有任何攻略及推荐，纯流水账哦！朋友们，你们来过广州和深圳吗？更喜欢哪，还是全都要呢？欢迎在评论区和我们聊聊。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvfheTp6q3rSbsHR1yaaADVvFfzN.jpg"><p><span>虹桥机场的免费办公区</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgrEEncW1O_M1kSo00aTsoUsb1uR.jpg"><p><span>乐凯撒</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljDwFOLGPboqzzQG2EzhayitaDzV.jpg"><p><span>通往海滩并有海母的通道</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtVzeREdPQ-IJxKZpM1HOaMUIU4I.jpg"><p><span>携带咖啡在海边溜达</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvWcjDhQ8A-s0Yu8cEESMe5-MXCY.jpg"><p><span>大量香菜的烧鸡公</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrIAQ0BpYwjLT-wd0tWfAF8_ekUd.jpg"><p><span>深圳的校服真好看，尤其藏蓝的</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhuG5zDoAhcLdBEHO-FHr7GfIi0p.jpg"><p><span>给老王送体温计，暖宝以及冷贴，一整个冰火两重天。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg7kKt5iWgVkvElUCrpaIDnfuiWq.jpg"><p><span>蛋蛋秀的哭泣</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsY8e_5GItRgGfd8RE554i_9PgPX.jpg"><p><span>整个酒店只有老几位在吃早饭</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lluUdh8KOPKrDdiLamYvc3a8-HXU.jpg"><p><span>津津菜馆的那位老式领班大哥，</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FriFWLlECEwkJYLNYNMyzkzuG64n.jpg"><p><span>没料到，免费水果有杨桃</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnb-8aWc4KiN2sVmITDnZmbmcMdE.jpg"><p><span>史密斯带我们去吃的好吃的烧鹅</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlrPhy2B0U3JMDuMidMHKwYGzFqh.jpg"><p><span>丰子恺画风的路边电箱</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpX7dcNz2bWr5nU_holEgGzuxRJ_.jpg"><p><span>口罩车牌1</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhJGXM3Ewa5LMWiit6EmNiVfHfUb.jpg"><p><span>口罩车牌2</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl4nVtI9xds_P_TpGO73YTMsAYW5.jpg"><p><span>我在星巴克哈利波特快闪店二楼喝了思乐冰2悲</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrozLjnXmlEmjMQ22W-Kz0X8TQ1g.jpg"><p><span>一个学院一个屋子</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liRafdUzHrHLYpYsT8cOmOjB9n7J.jpg"><p><span>原来树叶掉下来也会划伤人</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lk7kYmPF_YKxdHUXWQFSisfPbtKd.jpg"><p><span>盛香亭好像本身就是卖卤味的</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lscn9IK6qD13NnwdsUfGYsTCp2aE.jpg"><p><span>华农好吃又好逛</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhiM7FQK9sBYvioIng_eygW_Etup.jpg"><p><span>遇到两位小友，问他们好吃不好吃，说一般。</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls1u5GGB8oZuf7ErvLK3aORiBe33.jpg"><p><span>恶毒的诅咒，温馨的提示</span></p><p><strong><span>【收听平台】</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>小宇宙|喜马拉雅|苹果播客|QQ音乐|网易云音乐|新浪微博|荔枝FM</span></strong></p><p><span>微博：@好大一个盆儿</span></p><p><span>听友群：添加微信“WANGLIZHUSHOU”备注“听友群”</span></p><p><span>商务合作：微信“WANGLIZHUSHOU”或邮箱：liangzhibee@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
